  "F1": "I grouped the sentences by structure: modifier next to its noun, modifier inside a coordinated noun phrase, modifier moved past adverbs, and modifier moved past a coordination. I gave the moved modifiers low ratings, worst when they pointed to the wrong noun, then added typical rating spread.",
